🧠 The Main Trick to Remember

The entire anagram concept can be remembered as:

"Same letters → sort them → compare them."

For example:

listen
   ↓
sorted()
   ↓
e i l n s t

silent
   ↓
sorted()
   ↓
e i l n s t

        ↓

Same → ANAGRAM ✅


🧒 Super-short memory trick
ANAGRAM = SAME LETTERS

SORT + COMPARE
       ↓
   same → YES
   different → NO
